  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n(10001 + 12) (10001 - 12)\n\n**Formula Used:**\n\n((a + b)(a - b) = a² - b²)\n\n**Calculation:**\n\nHere, a = 10001 and b = 12\n\nUsing the formula:\n\n((10001 + 12)(10001 - 12) = 10001² - 12²)\n\n⇒ 10001² - 12²\n\n⇒ 100020001 - 144\n\n⇒ 100019857\n\n**The value of (10001 + 12)(10001 - 12) is 100019857.**",
